Subject: [PATCH 03414/11362] [conductor] PHASE B1 (RESERVED INFRA) -- make
 LIVE-SUBMITTABLE LEVEL COUNT (offline-reproduced AND has a replayable
 trajectory/env-adaptive re-solver AND env-matchable) a capstone CO-HEADLINE
 metric, distinct from reproducible_total_levels (the GAP-LIVE-INTEGRATION
 "mirage": raw reproducible includes banked replays that do not live-submit).
 Surfaces the honest submittable score (33 baseline) alongside
 reproducible_total_levels + generic_transfer + action efficiency. Asserting
 tests.

Automated research step by research conductor.
Task ID: exp4586-b1

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
