 - SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4585: The artifact `results/experiment_4585_integration_gate.json` must emit top-level fields for `honest_verdict`, `inference_substrate`, `live_submittable_level_count_integrated`, `generic_transfer_rate_integrated`, `levers_integrated`, `additivity_checked`, `core_solves_preserved`, `parity_green`, `ready_for_operator_submit`, `false_negative_risk_checked`, `random_seed`, `reproducibility_checksum`, and `preconditions_checked`; it must also include `generic_transfer_ci_integrated`, `held_out_solve_rate`, `per_game_deepest_level_integrated`, `held_out_deepest_level_by_game`, `integrated_package_path`, `submitted_agent_config`, `upstream_lever_audit`, `disallowed_adversarial_inputs`, `field_principles`, and spec references. A success verdict requires `live_submittable_level_count_integrated > 33` or `generic_transfer_rate_integrated > 0.04`, with no CORE solve dropped and no online submission.
 - SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4585-FIELD-PRINCIPLES: The required field principles are: `honest_verdict` = "terminal prefix; success: integrated_live_submittable_above_33_or_generic_transfer_above_0.04 OR complete: no_lever_raises_a_metric_honest_null."; `inference_substrate` = "verifier_ensemble_against_cached_candidates -- offline arcade end-to-end; if live LLM proposer is invoked, declare live_llm_inference with the Qwen3.5-9B-MTP iGPU precondition, never the 3090s."; `live_submittable_level_count_integrated` = "the SUBMITTED-config live-submittable count after wiring winners vs the 33 baseline -- the headline score lever."; `generic_transfer_rate_integrated` = "the SUBMITTED-config held-out variant transfer after wiring winners vs baseline 0.04 -- the leaderboard-honest transfer headline."; `levers_integrated` = "names which of A1/A2/A3/A4 were wired -- traceable to their measured deltas; [] is an honest null."; `additivity_checked` = "integrated metric vs the naive sum of isolated deltas -- surfaces a destructive interaction instead of burying it."; `core_solves_preserved` = "integration must preserve every CORE solve (set-containment); a dropped solve FAILS the lever."; `parity_green` = "test_arc_submitted_agent_parity.py stays green after wiring -- the single-source-of-truth guard."; `ready_for_operator_submit` = "True if the integrated config + refreshed package beat the 33-level scorecard on a real metric worth a 1/day submission slot; the task NEVER submits (operator-only)."; `false_negative_risk_checked` = "an honest null is only valid with both baselines measured the same way."; `random_seed` = "determinism precondition for reproducibility."; `reproducibility_checksum` = "catches silent drift on replay."; `preconditions_checked` = "records resources verified; pre-empts missing-resource fabrication."
+- REQ-CAPSTONE-4586: The live-submittable co-headline workflow must compute the live-submittable level count from `ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml` plus the refreshed operator-only package manifest, count a level only when it is offline-reproduced, has a replayable trajectory or env-adaptive resolver, and is environment-matchable, and report the reproducible-vs-submittable gap beside the existing co-headline metrics. The workflow SHALL expose a shared helper for capstones, SHALL keep `reproducible_total_levels` as raw banked capability context rather than leaderboard score, SHALL report `live_submittable_level_count` as the honest leaderboard score, SHALL import generic-transfer and action-efficiency co-headline values from the existing .422 helper/artifact, SHALL not modify `scripts/research_conductor.py`, SHALL not submit online, and SHALL write `results/experiment_4586_live_submittable_coheadline.json`.
+- SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4586: The artifact `results/experiment_4586_live_submittable_coheadline.json` must emit top-level principle-annotated fields for `honest_verdict`, `inference_substrate`, `live_submittable_level_count`, `reproducible_total_levels`, `reproducible_vs_submittable_gap`, `metric_wired_into_capstone`, `tests_added_pass`, and `preconditions_checked`; it must also emit `generic_transfer_rate_over_variants`, `generic_transfer_ci`, `action_efficiency_score`, `action_efficiency_ci`, `honest_metric_framing`, `per_game_live_submittable`, `refreshed_package_path`, `leaderboard_submission:false`, spec references, random seed, and a reproducibility checksum. The default run must prove live-submittable is a subset of reproducible total, exclude a banked level with no trajectory/adaptive resolver, include a trajectory-backed env-match row, and report `reproducible_vs_submittable_gap = reproducible_total_levels - live_submittable_level_count`.
+- SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-4586-FIELD-PRINCIPLES: The required field principles are: `honest_verdict` = "terminal prefix; shipped: live_submittable_coheadline_wired OR complete: live_submittable_coheadline_partial_<reason>."; `inference_substrate` = "verifier_ensemble_against_cached_candidates -- computes the count over the registry/package offline, no LLM load."; `live_submittable_level_count` = "the honest leaderboard score (offline-reproduced AND trajectory AND env-matchable) -- the metric this task formalizes."; `reproducible_total_levels` = "the raw banked-capability count (53) -- reported alongside to expose the mirage gap."; `reproducible_vs_submittable_gap` = "reproducible_total_levels - live_submittable_level_count -- the GAP-LIVE-INTEGRATION number that drives the A1 headline."; `metric_wired_into_capstone` = "names where all co-headline metrics are now reported side-by-side -- the fix that surfaces the honest score."; `tests_added_pass` = "Tests Must Run and Assert -- subset, exclude-no-trajectory, include-with-trajectory, gap-reported."; `preconditions_checked` = "records resources verified; pre-empts missing-resource fabrication."
